  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-04-21T04:58:51.754Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hello, I'm VRChat Korean Player.\n\nBefore say it, each country's 'chinese character, (漢字)' font has been modified to suit each country's standards, using the format of 'Kangxi dictionary, (康熙字典)'.\n\nThe font of 'Chinese characters, (漢字)' is different from country to country. Chinese characters used in 'China(中國)', 'Japan(日本)', and 'Korea(韓國)' are divided into 'CJK' fonts.\n\nHowever, Chinese characters in the current Website and In-game are basically Japanese fonts, except for a few.\n\n(This is also an issue in Unicode.)\n\nTherefore, can't split the font for system. So I'd like font designer to change it to a 'Kangxi dictionary-based font'.\n\nI think this is a way that is not biased to one side.\n\nThank you for reading it. :)",
